B.aPO=s(["Create a PhysiciansApply.ca account (the MCC's document-verification portal)","Submit a Source Verification Request for your medical degree and pay the fee","Demonstrate English or French language proficiency","Apply for and sit the MCCQE at a Prometric centre within your 12-month eligibility window","Obtain your LMCC (Licentiate of the Medical Council of Canada) after passing","Apply to the medical regulatory authority in the province/territory where you intend to practise"],t.s)
