B.b04=new A.bZ(!0,"Provincial regulatory college","e.g. College of Nurses of Ontario \u2014 varies by province","Licensing is provincial, not federal. NNAS (National Nursing Assessment Service) is the common first step for internationally educated nurses and issues an Advisory Report accepted by regulators in every province except Quebec and the territories \u2014 those have their own separate process.",!0,!0,"Confirmed against nnas.ca, Jul 2026.",null,null)
B.b0e=new A.bZ(!0,"Provincial regulator","e.g. PEO (Ontario), EGBC (British Columbia)",'"Engineer" is a protected title in Canada. Licensing is provincial; Engineers Canada coordinates mutual recognition between provinces.',!0,!1,null,null,null)
